<title>UK: UK's Brown begins budget speech.</title>
<headline>UK's Brown begins budget speech.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Chancellor of the Exchequer Gordon Brown stood up to begin his first budget speech to parliament at 1447 GMT.</p>
